commits.message:
SCA-4763: add the canary_only stop as the canary evidence producer

The regular deploy job now stops after the isolated canary qualifies:

- new pusher_canary_only input, validated for prod Pusher with the exact
  qualified digest and qualification run and no break-glass option;
- the canary inverse receipt records mode=canary_only and a redacted
  per-field-class parity of the canary Pod template against live
  prod-omi-pusher, excluding the image;
- every promote-side step (shared-config apply, surge gate, Helm, deployment
  receipt, alert reverification, final-candidate comparison, summary and
  notifier) is gated on env.CANARY_ONLY != 'true';
- the image-only promote accepts only a canary_only receipt;
- the runbook names the manual restore command, its admission prerequisites
  and the required serving readback;
- the CI budget trigger inventory records the new input.

fix(cron): let the gateway own skipped-home errors on the restart-safe worker path

The queued send runs _deliver_result in the gateway, which already reports each skipped home;
appending the worker's copy repeated it in the delivery result.

